-- Batch 3 part 3 (players 1001-1050), 2026-10-09: clubs the career-stats extractor could not link.
-- Apply AFTER players_batch3_part3_stats.sql. Safe to repeat.
-- Adds the real clubs missing from the pool (scope = country, no badge or aliases) and points
-- these players' career rows at them. Reserve, B and youth teams are left unlinked on purpose,
-- as in earlier batches. Pulisic's nameless '(row 3)' row is an artefact of his article's infobox and stays unlinked.

